      "One day, a mother hyena carried her little blind cub and laid it gently at Macarius' feet. Macarius felt so sorry for the tiny creature. He knelt, prayed, and touched its eyes — and the little cub could see! The next day, the mother came back and laid a sheepskin at his feet, as a thank-you gift.",
